<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Jefferson Smurfit Corp Q3 net income $22mln.</title>
<headline>Jefferson Smurfit Corp Q3 net income $22mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million $ unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income per shr ($) 0.20		   vs 0.67</p>
<p> Net income		 22		     vs 74</p>
<p> Net sales		  834		    vs 1,051</p>
<p>NOTE - Jefferson Smurfit Corporation, a U.S. associate of Jefferson Smurfit Group reported a $98 million net profit for the nine months to September 30, 1996 compared with a net profit of $179 in the same period of 1995.  </p>
<p> Income from operations 86		     vs 185</p>
<p> Income tax provision   16 charge	    vs 49   charge</p>
<p>				  Nine months to September 30 1996</p>
<p> Net income per shr ($) 0.88		   vs 1.62</p>
<p> Net income		 98		     vs 179</p>
<p> Net sales		  2,594		  vs 3,120</p>
<p> Income from operations 316		    vs 476</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
